----------------------------------------------------------------------

This project is a fork / reskin of "Robotics Roadmap" by Woolim Park
(https://github.com/woolimi/robotics-roadmap). The rendering engine in site/
is reused under the MIT license above, with its copyright notice preserved.

The curriculum in lessons/ (branches.yaml and every lessons/<id>/README.md) is
original content written for this automotive roadmap, not the upstream lessons.

The tree silhouettes in site/src/components/treeArt.ts are third-party icons:
"mechanical-arm" (Lorc) and "mars-curiosity" (Delapouite) from game-icons.net
under CC BY 3.0, and "brain-circuit" from Microsoft Fluent UI System Icons (MIT).
